		|	Period
		|;
		|
		|////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
		|SELECT
		|	TTProducts_1.Period					AS Period,
		|	TTProducts_1.Warehouse					AS Warehouse,
		|	TTProducts_1.Recipient				AS Recipient,
		|	TTProducts_1.DocumentShipments		AS DocumentShipments,
